      "rationale": "Ereirĩtie rĩa mbere rĩrĩa kĩugo kĩa Kohereni gĩkĩhũthĩka mbere ya ũndũ mũkũhĩ nĩgetha ũhoro wĩ na mũhianĩre ũtekambanie."
