    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "bhealothekha",
      "rationale": "Ereirĩtie 'kũinĩrĩra' nĩ kuuma kĩugo kĩa Kĩhibirania kĩonanania na kũrahũra matũũra, na kĩngĩkorwo nĩ 'kũhenũka', nĩkĩo kĩrĩa andũ aingĩ metĩkĩirie."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "nêrôt \/ hânêrôt",
      "rationale": "Kiugo kĩa ner kĩrahũthagio kaingĩ hamwe na kĩrĩa kĩhũthagio kũonania mũhiano, na kĩrĩa gĩtangĩkomerethia mũhiano ũcio na Gĩkũyũ."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Rora Aharoni, ũmũũre ũguo: rĩrĩa wĩrahũraga ⟨את⟩ matũũra, kũrĩ mbere ya ũthondeki wa menora, matũũra manje nĩmakĩratha kũrĩ mbere ya menora.",
